{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47435","headline":"题赤松宫 · 舒道纪","name":"题赤松宫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松老赤松原，松间庙宛然。\n人皆有兄弟，谁得共神仙。\n双鹤冲天去，羣羊化石眠。\n至今丹井水，香满北山边。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"舒道纪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47435.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47435","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}